tsu"},{"en":"Robo-Humans Of The Battlefield"},{"ja":"\u767d\u3044\u4e16\u754c\u306e\u602a\u7269"},{"en":"Pictures at an Exhibition"},{"ja":"\u5c55\u89a7\u4f1a\u306e\u7d75"}],"description":{"en":"Collection of most of Go Nagai's short stories under one title, with each volume mainly focusing on a central theme. \n\nNames of volumes and some of the stories they include:\nVol 1: Swordsman of hell\n1. Thief-taker Polikichi (Meakashi Polikichi) \n2.\n3. Swordsman of hell \n4.\n5.\n6.\n7.\n\nVol 2: Suspense\u30fbPuns \n1. Glorious Sanjiro\n2. Nagai's Fantasy World Pun (Parody of his sensei's [Fantasy World Jun](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/c7a47226-5e2a-47b8-9b35-728683d70faf\/fantasy-world-jun))\n3.\n4. Pictures at an Exhibition\n5.\n6.\n7. La Samurai\n8. Playboy!! Teacher\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12. \n13.\n\nVol 3: Ultra-Spy Bearded Godzilla\n1. Receive-chan\n2.\n3. Mystery boy X-kun\n4. Ultra-Spy Bearded Godzilla\n5.\n6.\n7.\n8.\n\nVol 4: Female leader Houin Daiko\n1. Waiting teacher\n2. Fighting Pants-kun\n3. Hunter-kun\n4. Female leader Houin Daiko\n5. Handsome-kun\n6.\n7. Kick-chan (Lover-kun) \n8. Sweet-chan\n\nVol 5: Wandering student\n1. Wild absurd manga series\n2. Wandering student\n3.\n4.\n\nVol 6: Oni rebellion of the year 2889\n1. Oni -Rebellion of the year 2889-\n2. Terrible tall tower\n3. Loved Ski-chan\n4. Marvelous Ultra Super Deluxe Man\n\nVol 7: GO! Go! Nonsense\n1. In the land where wild cattle roam\n2. Komat Charm\n3. GO! Go! Nonsense\n\nVol 8: Susumu-chan's big shock\n1. Vampire hunt\n2.\n3. Boy hunter\n4.\n5. Captain Burst\n6. Golgo 17-18-19\n7. Susumu-chan's big shock\n8. Sanjiro\n\nVol 9: Chaka-Poko\n1. Chan-kun \n2. Chaka-Poko\n\nVol 10: Break down\n1. 100 yen beauty\n2.\n3. Break Down\n4.\n5.\n6.\n\nVol 11: Enoshima's stupid-zilla (dozilla)\n1. Food cart king\n2. \n3. \n4. Enoshima's stupid-zilla \n\nVol 12: Monster of the white world\n1. Monster of the white world\n2. Ganbare Supokon-kun! (Part 1-4)\n3. Lightning man thunder\n\nVol 13: Bakuratsu classroom\n1. Bakuratsu classroom\n2. Pushy Physician (Episode 1-3)\n3. Rage-man\n\nVol 14: Nuisance detective Iboji Kogorou\n(4 chapters) \n\nVol 15: Go-Chan Magazine\n1. The Birth of Sirene\n2. Red loincloth Suzunosuke\n3. Kingoro's and Marilyn's days\n4. Suiko - Green lake \n5. Go Nagai's true life ghost story - Face youkai\n6. Robo humans of the battlefield\n7. Go Nagai's marvelous 40 years\n[Vol. 15 - mangaupdates](https:\/\/www.mangaupdates.com\/series\/hbneccg\/gou-chan-magajin)"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"172425","mu":"4gqwmkl","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/100597\/","mal":"144910"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"15","lastChapter":"7","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":1967,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"07251805-a27e-4d59-b488-f0bfbec15168","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Thriller"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"292e862b-2d17-4062-90a2-0356caa4ae27","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Time Travel"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"33771934-028e-4cb3-8744-691e866a923e","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Historical"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"39730448-9a5f-48a2-85b0-a70db87b1233","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Demons"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag