ono"},{"ja-ro":"Perfect Soldier"},{"ja-ro":"Migi no Tabi"},{"ja-ro":"Edible"},{"ja-ro":"Kisei!! Ekoda-chan"},{"ja-ro":"Agonashi Gen to Ore wa Kiseijuu"},{"ja":"\u7531\u826f\u306e\u9580\u3092"},{"ja":"\u4eca\u591c\u3082Eat it"},{"ja":"\u30d0\u30d0\u5f8c\u6094\u3059"},{"ja":"\u30eb\u30fc\u30b7\u30a3\u3068\u30df\u30ae\u30fc"},{"ja":"\u6559\u3048\u3066\uff01\u7530\u5bae\u826f\u5b50\u5148\u751f"},{"ja":"\u5909\u308f\u308a\u3082\u306e"},{"ja":"\u30df\u30ae\u30fc\u306e\u65c5"},{"ja":"\u5bc4\u751f!! \u6c5f\u53e4\u7530\u3061\u3083\u3093"},{"ja":"\u30a2\u30b4\u306a\u3057\u30b2\u30f3\u3068\u30aa\u30ec\u306f\u5bc4\u751f\u7363"},{"en":"Migi's Travels"},{"en":"Lucy and Migi"},{"en":"Parasyte X Fairy Tail"}],"description":{"en":"Kiseijuu's tribute manga series of original stories by various mangaka.\n\n- Chapter 1. **Through Yura's Gate (\u7531\u826f\u306e\u9580\u3092, Yura no Mon wo)** by Moto Hagio\n- Chapter 2. **Eat it Tonight, Too (\u4eca\u591c\u3082Eat it, Konya mo Eat It)** by Moare Ota\n- Chapter 3. **Granny's Regrets (\u30d0\u30d0\u5f8c\u6094\u3059, Baba Koukaisu)** by Takayuki Takeya\n- Chapter 4. **Paragrant** by Nirasawa Yasushi\n- Chapter 5. **Lucy and Migi (\u30eb\u30fc\u30b7\u30a3\u3068\u30df\u30ae\u30fc, Lucy to Migi)** by Hiro Mashima\n- Chapter 6. **Teach me! Ryoko Tamiya-sensei (\u6559\u3048\u3066\uff01\u7530\u5bae\u826f\u5b50\u5148\u751f, Oshiete! Tamiya Ryouko-sensei)** by Peach-Pit\n- Chapter 7. **The Strange One (\u5909\u308f\u308a\u3082\u306e, Kawarimono)** by Takatoshi Kumakura\n- Chapter 8. **Perfect Soldier** by Ryoji Minagawa\n- Chapter 9. **Migi's Journey (\u30df\u30ae\u30fc\u306e\u65c5, Migi no Tabi)** by Richi Ueshiba\n- Chapter 10. **Edible** by Endou Hiroki\n- Chapter 11. **Kisei!! Ekoda-chan (\u5bc4\u751f!! \u6c5f\u53e4\u7530\u3061\u3083\u3093)** by Yukari Takinami\n- Chapter 12. **Chinless Gen and Me are Parasytes (\u30a2\u30b4\u306a\u3057\u30b2\u30f3\u3068\u30aa\u30ec\u306f\u5bc4\u751f\u7363, Agonashi Gen to Ore wa Kiseijuu)** by Akira Hiramoto"